OL,4,G1600FComposer of the Week: Palestrina
OL,5,     GA lifelong friendship, a papal
OL,6,     Gjubilee, and a revamped St
OL,7,     GPeter's, but also some hard-
OL,8,     Ghitting losses... Donald Macleod
OL,9,     Gsees why Palestrina is
OL,10,     Gconsidering becoming a priest.
OL,11,G1700FIn Tune
OL,12,     GPetroc Trelawny presents live
OL,13,     Gmusic from Intesa Duo.
OL,14,G1900FClassical Mixtape
OL,15,     GTake time out with a 30-minute
OL,16,     Gsoundscape of classical
OL,17,     Gfavourites, including music by
OL,18,     GJ.S. Bach, Helvi Leiviska and
OL,19,     GRachmaninov.
