OL,12,     FSt
OL,13,     GDr Rommi Smith examines a key
OL,14,     Gmoment in the life and work of
OL,15,     Gfive Black female musicians.
OL,16,     GToday she considers the political
OL,17,     Gawakening of Nina Simone.
